/ locals: current_server, cards_available, admin_tools_available, player_joined
= turbo_frame_tag "server_features"
  - if cards_available || admin_tools_available
    - if cards_available && !player_joined
      = render "servers/not_joined", current_server:

    - if cards_available && player_joined
      / Feature cards — each gates on its command being enabled for the community
      .row.g-4
        / Me
        - if command_accessible?("me")
          = render "servers/players/me_card", current_server:

        / Gamble
        - if command_accessible?("gamble")
          = render "servers/gambling/card", current_server:, gamble_stat: gamble_stat_for(current_server)

        / Rewards
        - if command_accessible?("reward")
          = render "servers/rewards/card", current_server:, \
            reward_package: reward_default_package_for(current_server), \
            reward_claim: reward_claim_for(current_server)

    / Admin tools — each gates on its command being enabled and the user's allowlist. An admin manages a server
    / whether or not they have ever played on it, so these are not held behind having joined.
    - if admin_tools_available
      .mt-4
        h2.h5.text-uppercase.text-secondary.mb-3 Admin tools

        / A bar rather than a card: one input needs one row, and every identifier an admin might walk in holding
        / enters through here so the resolution stays server-side.
        - if command_accessible?("info")
          = render "servers/players/lookup", current_server:

        .row.g-4
          / SQF Console
          - if command_accessible?("sqf")
            = render "servers/sqf/card", current_server:
  - else
    .card
      .card-body.text-center.py-5
        i.bi.bi-toggles.display-4.text-secondary.mb-3.d-block
        h4.mb-2 Nothing enabled here yet
        p.text-muted.mx-auto style="max-width: 34rem;"
          | The community running #{current_server.server_id} hasn't enabled any ESM features for this server yet. If you think something should be available, let the server's admins know.
